{
  "id": "6aa8ce975df50db920a97d58",
  "title": "人の髪型を見て髪型名を当ててみる",
  "created": 1789447832,
  "updated": 1789447962,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce975df50db920a97d58",
      "text": "人の髪型を見て髪型名を当ててみる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447962
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7841",
      "text": " [メンズのヘアスタイルのいろいろ]で知った新しい言葉と髪型を覚えるために、実在の人の髪型に髪型名をあてる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447909
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9e00000000007c787d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447838,
      "updated": 1789447838
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7842",
      "text": "実在?する人を見て髪型の名前を当ててみる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447838
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7843",
      "text": " [マッシュル]の[マッシュバーンデッド]さん[. https://mashle.pw/character/]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7844",
      "text": "  [マッシュ]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7845",
      "text": "  襟足は短く切られているが、刈り込みの質感はない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7846",
      "text": "  サイドは刈り込まれたような長さだが、刈り込みの質感はない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7847",
      "text": " [五条悟][. https://times.abema.tv/articles/-/8638921]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7848",
      "text": "  長い髪でピンピンしてる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7849",
      "text": "  サイドは地肌部分がおそらく刈り込まれており、上から伸びてる髪がかかっている",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c784a",
      "text": "  襟足は刈り上げてるみたい",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c784b",
      "text": " [爆豪]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c784c",
      "text": "  尖った感じが、[スパイキーショート][. https://minx-net.co.jp/styling/6723]の髪型と似てるが、より長いように見える",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c784d",
      "text": " [Henry Lau]さん",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c784e",
      "text": "  違った、探しているのはこの人でなくてどなただっけ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c784f",
      "text": " [Travis Stewart]([Machinedrum])",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7850",
      "text": "  https://datatransmission.co/blog/festival-chat-machinedrum-field-day/ の赤いネックレスを付けた長髪の画像",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7851",
      "text": "   かっこいい",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7852",
      "text": "   コンピューターナードな雰囲気だ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7853",
      "text": "  https://www.insomniac.com/music/artists/machinedrum/  の真ん中で髪を分けた長髪",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7854",
      "text": "   アーティストの写真といった感じ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7855",
      "text": "  https://www.beatportal.com/playlists/1428905-playlist-of-the-week-machinedrum の冒頭の画像",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7856",
      "text": "   [Machinedrum - BOUNCE N SLIDE]のYoutube動画のサムネイル画像になってる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7857",
      "text": "   撮影前にヘアメイクをプロの方が行ったという感じ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7858",
      "text": "   すべてのの写真のなかで一番清潔感を感じるなあ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7859",
      "text": "  https://musictech.com/features/interviews/machinedrum-travis-stewart-demoscene-tracker-3for82/ の画像",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c785a",
      "text": "   サイドがだいぶ刈り込まれてる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c785b",
      "text": "   頭頂部一体に髪がある",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c785c",
      "text": "   後ろはどうなってるかわからない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c785d",
      "text": "   普段からこの髪型で過ごされていそうな感じ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c785e",
      "text": "  [Machinedrum Boiler Room NY Live Set https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pyk6nSwVfNY]ではべっちゃりしている",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c785f",
      "text": "  [2012年のTaicoclubの動画 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D6s_hHUGwd4]ではさらに長い長髪で汗も書いていそうなのに、かっこよく見えるな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7860",
      "text": "   [- [GBYE]を好んで聞いていたことがあるから[ハロー効果]かも？ 曲がかっこいいので鳴らしている人もかっこいい]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7861",
      "text": "   [十分に髪の量が多いと汗を書いてもべちゃっとしては見えない]のかも",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7862",
      "text": "   Boiler Roomのほうはこちらの動画より髪の量が少なくて不十分なのかな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7863",
      "text": " [レオナルド・ディカプリオ]さん(ウルフ・オブ・ウォールストリートの) ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7864",
      "text": "  ポマードで撫でつけたような髪型",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7865",
      "text": "  でも油っぽい感じはしないな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7866",
      "text": "  片側にある髪をもう片側に向かって撫でつけたような",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7867",
      "text": "  [オールバック]ではない、なんと言うんだこの髪型は",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7868",
      "text": " https://www.instagram.com/p/C_2sh-3vsIZ/",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7869",
      "text": "  こんな髪型もあるんだ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c786a",
      "text": "  髪の癖、前髪の立ち上がりをつけるのには[スポットパーマ]というのを使うんだ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c786b",
      "text": "   これってコテとかヘアアイロンのこと？",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c786c",
      "text": "  [スポットパーマで検索 https://www.google.com/search?q=スポットパーマ]すると前髪が立ち上がった髪型がたくさん表示された",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c786d",
      "text": "   [「ダウンパーマで作るおすすめメンズヘア」という画像]の[カルマヘア]みたいな形が多い",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c786e",
      "text": "   へー[トランクス]さんの髪型なので[トランクスヘア]とも呼ばれるんだ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c786f",
      "text": "    ほんとうだ似てる→ [. https://hidehair.jp/hairstyle-trunks]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7870",
      "text": " [Tilian Pearson](4ピースバンドの[Dance Gavin Dance]のボーカリストの方)",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7871",
      "text": "  髪を垂らしてる",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7872",
      "text": "   [トランクスヘアの作り方]の[shun___fukuda]さんの動画みたいにしてるのかな",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7873",
      "text": "    液剤を吹き付けて、",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7874",
      "text": " [ジョージ-メンズコーチ-] ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7875",
      "text": "  Youtubeチャンネルのアイコン画像を見る [. https://www.youtube.com/@coachjoji]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7876",
      "text": "  サイドを刈り上げていて、頭頂部に短くない髪がある",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7877",
      "text": "  ツーブロではない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7878",
      "text": "   サイドから頭頂部はグラデーションになっている、2つの別々な髪の長さがあるのでない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c7879",
      "text": "  [Tilian Pearson]さんと同様に、おでこの前で片側からもう片側に向かって垂らし、撫でつけている",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa8ce9700000000007c787a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789447832,
      "updated": 1789447832
    }
  ]
}